@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M14 — Actual attempt, cancellation request and runner uncertainty
state "Queued admitted attempt" as Queued
state "Running confirmed" as Running
state "Cancellation requested" as Cancel
state "Succeeded under result\ncontract" as Succeeded
state "Definite failed attempt" as Failed
state "Cancellation / stop\nconfirmed" as Cancelled
state "Attempt state unknown" as Unknown
[*] --> Queued : scoped initial context
Queued --> Running : SM-T081 start confirmed\n[enabled / actual start]
Queued --> Cancelled : SM-T082 queued cancel confirmed\n[queue cancellation confirmed]
Running --> Succeeded : SM-T083 success confirmed\n[required success confirmed]
Running --> Failed : SM-T084 failure confirmed\n[definite failed result]
Running --> Cancel : SM-T085 cancel requested\n[request only]
Cancel --> Cancelled : SM-T086 stop confirmed\n[actual stop confirmed]
Cancel --> Succeeded : SM-T087 completion won race\n[actual success evidence]
Cancel --> Failed : SM-T088 failure won race\n[actual failure evidence]
Running --> Unknown : SM-T089 runner / result lost\n[actual state unresolved]
Cancel --> Unknown : SM-T090 stop outcome lost\n[termination unconfirmed]
Unknown --> Running : SM-T091 runner reconciled\n[same attempt still running]
Unknown --> Succeeded : SM-T092 result reconciled\n[same attempt success]
Unknown --> Failed : SM-T093 result reconciled\n[same attempt failed]
Unknown --> Cancelled : SM-T094 stop reconciled\n[same attempt stop proved]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
